            "title": "About Me",
            "summary": "Hi, I'm Hayden, I am a 15-year-old crochet artist. I love to crochet as a hobby and once I found out I could&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Hi, I'm Hayden, I am a 15-year-old crochet artist. I love to crochet as a hobby and once I found out I could make my hobby into a business I was so exicted! I have been doing markets sence summer of last year (2025), and it has been SO fun to do what I love, and make it a busniess as well, and I hope you enjoy my creations as much as I do. </p>\n<figure class=\"post__image post__image--wide\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/hayden.jpg\" alt=\"Hayden\" width=\"1081\" height=\"540\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-xs.jpg 300w ,https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-sm.jpg 480w ,https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-md.jpg 768w ,https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://megahedron.github.io/haydenscozycreations/media/posts/3/responsive/hayden-2xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure>",
